<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 25/26.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 25/26.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania  set on</p>
<p>the following currency fixings for Thursday, June 26 on</p>
<p>Wednesday. The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of</p>
<p>four to one.</p>
<p>		   26.06.97	  25.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.6612	    6.6730</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3269	    2.3223</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5582	    4.5526</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5205	    3.4919</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5197	    0.5189</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7764	    0.7769</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2909	    0.2896</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0256	    7.0120</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6937	    0.6943</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2371	    1.2363</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
